      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates interpreting inside bars as compression rather than automatic signals using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示将内包线理解为压缩而非自动信号。"
    },
